## 10. AI-First: Our Main Rule

### Why This Works for a One-Person Business

**Our rule:** Use AI to test everything first. Always.

This isn't just about testing our product. It's how we run the whole business.

### Where We Use AI First

| Task | How AI Helps First |
|------|-------------------|
| Product testing | AI tests the system before humans do |
| New features | AI reviews changes before we ship them |
| Documentation | AI checks that instructions are accurate |
| Customer questions | AI answers basic questions first |
| Bug fixing | AI investigates problems before humans do |
| Marketing | AI writes drafts, humans polish |
| Competitor research | AI scans, humans make sense of it |

### Why AI-First Is Perfect for One-Person Businesses

| Reason | Benefit |
|--------|---------|
| Speed | Feedback in minutes, not weeks |
| Scale | Handle more than one person ever could |
| Always on | 24/7, no scheduling needed |
| Cost | Almost free per task |
| Objectivity | No office politics |
| Fast fixes | Fix problems the same day |

### How AI-First Testing Works

```
Any new feature or change
        |
        v
AI tests it first
        |
        v
AI passes or fails
        |
        |-- Fails --> Fix it, try again
        |
        --> Passes --> Then humans test it
                |
                v
        Ship with confidence
```

**AI is the first checker for everything. Humans are the backup.**

